# /employers/ — the public Employer Enquiry entry point.
#
# Hitting /employers/ without a filename lands on index.php, same
# as the top-level site. Directory listing is off so the file list
# is never exposed. PHP execution stays on (it's a form).

DirectoryIndex index.php
Options -Indexes

# Light hardening: this is public and unauthenticated, so block
# access to anything non-public that might be dropped in here by
# mistake (dotfiles, backups).
<FilesMatch "^\.|\.(bak|log|ini|md|sql)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
